[{"id":"c12-framework-not-oracle","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 应用开发","tags":["Agent 应用开发","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(十二)框架迁移.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(十二)框架迁移","articlePath":"posts/df3794c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(十二)框架迁移.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(十二)框架迁移","articlePath":"posts/df3794c/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“中断恢复”的课程边界中，为什么“框架”不是“Oracle”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>框架负责编排和生命周期，Oracle 负责判定业务结果；换框架不会自动产生正确性证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>框架迁移只替换状态编排层，业务 Oracle、权限和失败边界保持不变；checkpointer 与 interrupt 是机制，不是正确性证明。把这条区别落到夹具：分别构造正常、越界和撤销样本，保存只实现一个 LangGraph 核心，用 state、checkpointer、interrupt 和 Command 重放一次审批流程。框架通过只能说明节点运行；业务状态、权限和副作用仍需独立检查。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"e05-nonindependent","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 质量工程","tags":["Agent 质量工程","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(五)统计与实验.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(五)统计与实验","articlePath":"posts/7faf8039/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(五)统计与实验.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(五)统计与实验","articlePath":"posts/7faf8039/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么“非独立”必须留下独立证据？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把“非独立”绑定到metric与sample；正常、越界和 Unknown 各运行一次，断言谨慎解释。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在stats夹具中，比较pass@k/pass^k与任务与重复，保留谨慎解释；相关样本和选择偏差会改变结论；报告分组键与未覆盖范围。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"f04-blacklist-not-sandbox","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Agent 安全","tags":["Agent 安全","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-security/Agent 安全(四)隔离与执行.md","articleTitle":"Agent 安全(四)隔离与执行","articlePath":"posts/a00c2389/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-security/Agent 安全(四)隔离与执行.md","articleTitle":"Agent 安全(四)隔离与执行","articlePath":"posts/a00c2389/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“资源限制”的课程边界中，为什么“黑名单”不是“沙箱”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>黑名单只能拦截已知字符串，沙箱还要限制文件、进程、网络和资源边界。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>执行隔离至少覆盖文件、进程、网络和资源；黑名单和 dry-run 是策略，不是 host isolation。把这条区别落到夹具：分别构造正常、越界和撤销样本，保存Fake executor 验证允许/拒绝文件、进程、网络和资源请求，并记录策略命中。没有内核或容器边界时只能称策略模拟；dry-run 不证明真实隔离。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-engine-session-scope","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["SQLAlchemy","Session"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Engine、连接池和 Session 应该分别是什么作用域？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Engine/连接池通常是应用级共享资源，Session 是请求级事务状态，不能跨请求共享同一个 Session。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Engine 管理连接池和方言配置，应用启动时创建、关闭时释放；Session 绑定一次请求的身份和事务，依赖开始时创建、结束时关闭。共享 Session 会让并发请求互相污染事务和对象状态；重复创建 Engine 则会耗尽连接并失去池化收益。用 lifespan 管 Engine、用 \u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 依赖管 Session，是可观察且容易测试的分界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-blocking-in-async","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["阻塞","事件循环"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务","articlePath":"posts/801e2897/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务","articlePath":"posts/801e2897/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何证明一个同步调用阻塞了事件循环？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>并发发起慢调用和无关的 \u003ccode>/live\u003c/code> 请求；若后者延迟与慢调用同步上升，再结合线程/事件循环指标定位。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>只测慢请求只能证明它慢，不能证明它阻塞了全局。用 \u003ccode>time.sleep\u003c/code> 或同步客户端做对照，再用 \u003ccode>asyncio.sleep\u003c/code> 或异步客户端替换；比较无关请求的 p95 延迟和完成顺序。修复后慢调用仍可能耗时，但无关请求应能在等待期间继续得到响应。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a10-iostat-pidstat","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["I/O","采样"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断","articlePath":"posts/997240e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断","articlePath":"posts/997240e7/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>iostat 和 pidstat -d 如何配合定位 I/O？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>iostat 看设备总体队列和延迟，pidstat -d 看进程读写；两者时间窗和采样间隔要一致。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两条命令要用相同采样窗口配对：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">iostat -xz 1 3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">pidstat -d -p ALL 1 3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>iostat\u003c/code> 说明设备队列、利用率和平均等待，\u003ccode>pidstat -d\u003c/code> 说明哪个进程发出了读写请求。设备忙可能来自多个进程或内核回写；进程写入成功也只代表系统调用返回，不能直接证明数据已经持久化到物理介质。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-11-skip-locked-worker-p2","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["SKIP LOCKED","队列","并发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制","articlePath":"posts/2d2f0ce4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制","articlePath":"posts/2d2f0ce4/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>多个 worker 领取 pending 订单时，如何避免互相等待？\u003ccode>SKIP LOCKED\u003c/code> 的代价是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">START\u003c/span> TRANSACTION;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;pending&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> id LIMIT \u003cspan class=\"number\">10\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOR\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SKIP\u003c/span> LOCKED;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SET\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;processing&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">IN\u003c/span> (...);\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">COMMIT\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>SKIP LOCKED\u003c/code> 把“等待”换成“跳过”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>选择\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>worker 行为\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>适用场景\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>普通 \u003ccode>FOR UPDATE\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>等待已锁行释放\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>需要看到全部候选\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>跳过已锁行，立即拿其他行\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>并行后台队列\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>返回的主键必须由当前 \u003ccode>SELECT\u003c/code> 驱动，再更新为 \u003ccode>processing\u003c/code>；不能硬编码一组可能已经被别的 worker 领取的 ID。跳过意味着顺序不再全局严格，worker 崩溃后的超时回收和重试也必须在状态机中定义。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-04-second-highest-salary-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["聚合","第二高薪","NULL"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合","articlePath":"posts/80283a7e/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合","articlePath":"posts/80283a7e/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询员工表中的第二高薪；如果最高薪并列，仍然返回严格意义上的第二个不同薪资。SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">MAX\u003c/span>(salary) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> second_salary\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> employees\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> salary \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">MAX\u003c/span>(salary) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> employees);\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>子查询先确定最高薪，外层再在严格更小的集合中取最大值：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">全部薪资 [15000, 15000, 12000, 9000]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓ salary &lt; MAX(salary)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">候选薪资 [12000, 9000]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓ MAX\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">第二个不同薪资 12000\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此最高薪并列不会重复计数；没有第二档时结果是 \u003ccode>NULL\u003c/code>。如果问题问的是“第二名员工”，还要定义并列处理和稳定排序，不能把两个题目混成同一个 \u003ccode>MAX\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-quality-deferred-annotation","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","3.14","注解","annotationlib"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python 3.14 的延迟注解对代码有什么提醒？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不要假定注解表达式在函数定义时已求值；需要运行时检查时使用当前标准接口获取注解。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>延迟注解意味着函数定义完成时，注解表达式不一定已经按普通表达式求值；这能减少前向引用和导入循环，但也会影响反射代码：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">from\u003c/span> annotationlib \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> Format, get_annotations\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">load\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">value: \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;Config&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>) -&gt; \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;Result&quot;\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">raw = get_annotations(load, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">format\u003c/span>=Format.STRING)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(raw[\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;value&quot;\u003c/span>])  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 需要字符串形式时显式选择格式\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>普通业务代码只依赖稳定的类型接口；框架、序列化器和依赖注入代码需要按当前 Python 版本的 \u003ccode>annotationlib\u003c/code> 文档选择求值格式，不能假设定义时已经拿到最终类型对象。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-env-main","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["__main__","模块执行","入口"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>if __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:\u003c/code> 解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它只在模块被当作程序入口执行时运行启动逻辑，被导入时保留函数和类供复用。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这个判断把“导入模块”与“启动程序”分开：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">main\u003c/span>() -&gt; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">int\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;run command&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> __name__ == \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">raise\u003c/span> SystemExit(main())\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>直接执行文件或使用 \u003ccode>python -m package\u003c/code> 时，入口模块的 \u003ccode>__name__\u003c/code> 才是 \u003ccode>&quot;__main__&quot;\u003c/code>；被其他模块导入时，函数和类可复用，但启动逻辑不会自动执行。把可测试逻辑放在 \u003ccode>main()\u003c/code> 外的普通函数中，也能避免导入副作用。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a03-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["敏捷","测试职责"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作","articlePath":"posts/562e1ecf/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作","articlePath":"posts/562e1ecf/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>敏捷是否意味着不需要测试人员？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不意味着。测试技能与活动融入全团队，质量共同负责，但专业分工和必要的独立测试仍然存在。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>借阅功能需要澄清规则、设计正反例、准备数据、检查结果和说明风险。缩短迭代只改变这些活动的协作节奏，不会让活动自动消失。在 Scrum 2020 中，Developers 是创建可用增量的人员，包含所需专业技能，不等同于“只写代码的人”。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>做法\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>对质量的影响\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>产品、测试、开发共同检查“三本上限”的例子\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>在规则进入代码前发现理解差异\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>开发结束后只把质量交给测试人员\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>风险集中到末尾，容易把未验证项当成完成\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>对安全关键部分保留独立验证\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>增加不同视角，补充全团队方法\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>全团队负责不等于取消个人专业职责，也不要求每个人具备相同技能。是否需要额外独立性，要看风险和适用要求。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-unicode-input","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","Unicode","输入"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试","articlePath":"posts/69145da7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试","articlePath":"posts/69145da7/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Unicode 数字或空白字符应该如何纳入输入测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先问需求是按字符类别、规范化结果还是 ASCII 字节校验，再分别测试全角数字、组合字符、前后空白和不可见字符。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>１２３\u003c/code>、阿拉伯数字和 ASCII \u003ccode>123\u003c/code> 视觉相似但码位不同，\u003ccode>strip()\u003c/code> 也不等于删除所有 Unicode 空白。用例应记录原始码点或可复现转义，观察系统是否拒绝、规范化或保留，并核对存储与日志是否一致。没有明确规范时，只能报告行为和待确认规则，不能凭个人习惯判定“应该接受”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a08-concept-2","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["规则简化","覆盖"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":15,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候可以合并判定表中的规则列？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>当条件取值不同却产生完全相同的动作、状态、错误和可观察证据，并且不影响后续流程时才可合并。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>若两个组合都拒绝，但一个返回错误码 A、一个返回错误码 B，不能合并；若日志审计、计费或库存副作用不同，也不能合并。合并后应保留规则到代表用例的追踪，必要时用一个代表值覆盖等价类，并记录被省略的组合和理由。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]